sequenceDiagram
    actor U as User
    participant C as CDN
    participant L as Load balancer
    participant S as App server
    participant R as Redis
    participant P as Postgres replica
    participant B as S3

    U->>C: GET /pastes/{code}
    alt cached at the CDN
        C-->>U: paste
    else not cached
        C->>L: forward request
        L->>S: forward request
        S->>R: look up code
        alt cache hit
            R-->>S: paste
        else cache miss
            S->>P: read row
            P-->>S: row (+ s3_key if large)
            opt text stored in S3
                S->>B: get text
                B-->>S: text
            end
            S->>R: save a copy (expires at expires_at)
        end
        alt expires_at has passed
            S-->>U: 404 Not Found
        else still valid
            S-->>U: paste
        end
    end
